Applies to:
  data/unyo.txt, data/dcyo.txt   the YAD test set (source and reference), unchanged
  predictions/*.txt              system outputs for every line of that test set

The YAD test set is from the Yoruba Automatic Diacritization (YAD) benchmark
(Olawole, Alabi, Sakpere and Adelani, 2024; https://github.com/ajesujoba/YAD),
which is built from MENYO-20k (Adelani et al., 2021). MENYO-20k is released
under CC BY-NC 4.0, and the files above inherit that licence. You may share and
adapt them for non-commercial purposes with attribution to YAD, MENYO-20k and
this repository.

